menu "Smart Wall Socket"

    choice SWS_BOARD
        prompt "Target board"
        default SWS_BOARD_DUALR3V2
        help
            Hardware the firmware runs on. Proto 0 is a Sonoff Dual R3 v2 used
            on the bench only; the EVT board is added when it exists.

        config SWS_BOARD_DUALR3V2
            bool "Proto 0: Sonoff Dual R3 v2 (BL0939)"
    endchoice

    config SWS_MATTER
        bool "Matter (Apple Home, Google Home)"
        default y
        help
            Two On/Off Plug-in Unit endpoints, commissioned over BLE. Matter
            also provisions Wi-Fi. Turn off for a lighter bench build that
            joins Wi-Fi from credentials stored in NVS.

    config SWS_TELEMETRY_PERIOD_S
        int "Telemetry period (s)"
        default 10
        range 5 300

    config SWS_HEARTBEAT_PERIOD_S
        int "Outage heartbeat period (s)"
        default 60
        range 30 600
        help
            How often the device records that it is alive (and its energy
            counters) in the dedicated nvs_hb partition. This is the
            resolution of outage start times and the most energy that can go
            unrecorded in one outage.

    config SWS_TZ_OFFSET_MIN
        int "Local time offset from UTC for schedules (minutes)"
        default 0
        range -720 840
        help
            Ghana is UTC+0 with no daylight saving.

endmenu
